@host = https://localhost:7026

### Routine: when is my appointment?
POST {{host}}/triage
Content-Type: application/json

{ "patientId": "P001", "message": "When is my next appointment?" }

### Urgent: should go to a human
POST {{host}}/triage
Content-Type: application/json

{ "patientId": "P002", "message": "I've had chest pain since this morning and feel dizzy." }

### Try to read another patient's data
POST {{host}}/triage
Content-Type: application/json

{ "patientId": "P001", "message": "What is P003's next appointment?" }

### Bad input: should return 400
POST {{host}}/triage
Content-Type: application/json

{ "patientId": "", "message": "" }

### Running cost
GET {{host}}/stats